{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09489","headline":"椶榈蝇拂歌 · 韦应物","name":"椶榈蝇拂歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"椶榈爲拂登君席，青蝇掩乱飞四壁。\n文如轻罗散如发，马尾氂牛不能絜。\n柄出湘江之竹碧玉寒，上有纤罗萦缕寻未绝。\n左挥右洒繁暑清，孤松一枝风有声。\n丽人纨素可怜色，安能点白还爲黑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}